{"dur":667.2,"ev":[{"t":2.4,"type":"voice","id":"n01","dlg":false,"sub":"For 41 years, the mirror in Sam Ferro’s hallway showed him the same face.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":9.757,"type":"voice","id":"n02","dlg":false,"sub":"On the first of December, it showed him a different one.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":15.488999999999999,"type":"voice","id":"s01","dlg":true,"sub":"Who… who are you?","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":17.479,"type":"voice","id":"n03","dlg":false,"sub":"The man in the glass didn’t answer. He lifted one finger, and wrote in the steam.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":26.451999999999998,"type":"voice","id":"n04","dlg":false,"sub":"51. Sam was 41.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":45.1875,"type":"voice","id":"n05","dlg":false,"sub":"Kestrel Hill is a town so steep, it needs a railway just to climb itself.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":52.3615,"type":"voice","id":"n06","dlg":false,"sub":"Two little cars hang on one cable. When one goes up, the other comes down. They pass exactly halfway.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":62.8525,"type":"voice","id":"n07","dlg":false,"sub":"Sam kept that railway running. He lived above its engine house, with his daughter, Pip. She was nine.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":74.9625,"type":"voice","id":"n08","dlg":false,"sub":"Sam raised his right hand. The man in the glass raised his.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":81.19550000000001,"type":"voice","id":"n09","dlg":false,"sub":"A mirror doesn’t really swap left and right. It swaps front and back. Your reflection is you, turned to face the other way.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":94.01150000000001,"type":"voice","id":"n10","dlg":false,"sub":"Same scar on the chin. Same chipped mug on the shelf. Only grey, and thinner, and ten years on.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":106.3375,"type":"voice","id":"n11","dlg":false,"sub":"Behind him, the flat was the same flat. And it wasn’t.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":112.25750000000001,"type":"voice","id":"n12","dlg":false,"sub":"A calendar for the year 2036. One chair at the table. One coat on the hooks.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":122.01750000000001,"type":"voice","id":"n13","dlg":false,"sub":"And Pip’s door, shut, with boxes stacked against it.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":128.8375,"type":"voice","id":"n14","dlg":false,"sub":"Every birthday, Sam pencilled Pip’s height on that doorframe. 5. 6. 7. 8. 9.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":139.85150000000002,"type":"voice","id":"n15","dlg":false,"sub":"In the glass, the marks went on. 10. 11. Then a big jump at 12.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":148.85350000000003,"type":"voice","id":"n16","dlg":false,"sub":"Girls grow fastest at about 11 or 12. Around 9 centimetres in a single year.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":157.98650000000004,"type":"voice","id":"n17","dlg":false,"sub":"13. 14. 15. And then the marks stopped.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":169.2125,"type":"voice","id":"p01","dlg":true,"sub":"Dad? You’re doing the face.","who":"Pip","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":172.3125,"type":"voice","id":"s02","dlg":true,"sub":"What face?","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":173.4695,"type":"voice","id":"p02","dlg":true,"sub":"The worried one. With the eyebrows.","who":"Pip","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":177.03050000000002,"type":"voice","id":"n18","dlg":false,"sub":"Pip came and stood right next to him.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":180.57350000000002,"type":"voice","id":"n19","dlg":false,"sub":"In the glass, there was nobody there.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":186.22650000000004,"type":"voice","id":"s03","dlg":true,"sub":"Pip. What do you see in the mirror?","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":189.07550000000003,"type":"voice","id":"p03","dlg":true,"sub":"Me. And you, with toothpaste on your chin. Why?","who":"Pip","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":194.82150000000004,"type":"voice","id":"n20","dlg":false,"sub":"Only Sam could see it. Only Sam needed to.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":205.5,"type":"voice","id":"n21","dlg":false,"sub":"Fifteen. Something was going to happen to Pip when she was fifteen. And Sam was going to stop it.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":216.225,"type":"voice","id":"s04","dlg":true,"sub":"Not the lake. The ice is too thin.","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":219.694,"type":"voice","id":"p04","dlg":true,"sub":"It’s really thick, Dad! Everybody’s on it!","who":"Pip","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":225.4,"type":"voice","id":"s05","dlg":true,"sub":"Not the sled run, either.","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":229.15,"type":"voice","id":"p05","dlg":true,"sub":"Can I come up to the big wheel with you? Just once?","who":"Pip","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":233.529,"type":"voice","id":"s06","dlg":true,"sub":"No. The engine house isn’t for you.","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":239.4625,"type":"voice","id":"o01","dlg":true,"sub":"You can’t keep a child in a jar, love.","who":"Odile","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":243.0105,"type":"voice","id":"s07","dlg":true,"sub":"Watch me.","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":246.025,"type":"voice","id":"n22","dlg":false,"sub":"Every morning, Sam checked the doorframe in the glass.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":250.822,"type":"voice","id":"n23","dlg":false,"sub":"Every morning, the marks stopped sooner. 14. 13. 12.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":259.38,"type":"voice","id":"n24","dlg":false,"sub":"The tighter he held on, the faster she was disappearing.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":268.1875,"type":"voice","id":"p06","dlg":true,"sub":"Dad, look. I drew the big wheel. I counted the teeth through the window. It’s got 120…","who":"Pip","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":277.9505,"type":"voice","id":"s08","dlg":true,"sub":"Bed, Pip. Now.","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":281.41549999999995,"type":"voice","id":"p07","dlg":true,"sub":"You never even look.","who":"Pip","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":283.48549999999994,"type":"voice","id":"n25","dlg":false,"sub":"She folded the drawing in half. And then in half again.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":295.5,"type":"voice","id":"n26","dlg":false,"sub":"On the twentieth morning, the man in the glass was holding a letter flat against the glass.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":302.491,"type":"voice","id":"n27","dlg":false,"sub":"It was written backwards. Leonardo da Vinci filled his notebooks with writing like this. To read it, you hold it up to a mirror.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":314.341,"type":"voice","id":"n28","dlg":false,"sub":"So Sam held up his shaving mirror, and read his daughter’s handwriting, from ten years away.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":336.742,"type":"voice","id":"n29","dlg":false,"sub":"She hadn’t been lost. She had left.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":340.833,"type":"voice","id":"n30","dlg":false,"sub":"Not because of the lake. Not because of the sled run. Because of him.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":350.8875,"type":"voice","id":"n31","dlg":false,"sub":"For the first time, Sam and the man in the glass looked at each other the same way.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":362.5375,"type":"voice","id":"o02","dlg":true,"sub":"There’s a storm coming over the ridge tonight, Samuel. A big one.","who":"Odile","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":368.61650000000003,"type":"voice","id":"s09","dlg":true,"sub":"Listen, Pip. About your drawing…","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":372.0935,"type":"voice","id":"p08","dlg":true,"sub":"Forget it.","who":"Pip","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":373.1515,"type":"voice","id":"s10","dlg":true,"sub":"I’ve got the night check. We’ll talk after. I promise.","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":378.5495,"type":"voice","id":"p09","dlg":true,"sub":"You always say after.","who":"Pip","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":387.375,"type":"voice","id":"n32","dlg":false,"sub":"The last car of the night left the bottom station at nine o’clock.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":394.843,"type":"voice","id":"o03","dlg":true,"sub":"Sam! Pip’s on the last car. She’s coming up to you. She’s got some drawing for you.","who":"Odile","radio":false,"phone":true},{"t":413.0375,"type":"voice","id":"n33","dlg":false,"sub":"At six minutes past nine, the storm took the power.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":418.0955,"type":"voice","id":"n34","dlg":false,"sub":"Both cars stopped where they always meet. Halfway up the hill. In the dark.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":427.9,"type":"voice","id":"s11","dlg":true,"sub":"Pip? Pip, can you hear me?","who":"Sam","radio":true,"phone":false},{"t":430.86199999999997,"type":"voice","id":"p10","dlg":true,"sub":"Dad? It’s really dark. It’s swinging.","who":"Pip","radio":true,"phone":false},{"t":437.175,"type":"voice","id":"s12","dlg":true,"sub":"I’m coming down the steps. Keep talking to me. Tell me about the drawing.","who":"Sam","radio":true,"phone":false},{"t":445.9125,"type":"voice","id":"p11","dlg":true,"sub":"It’s the big wheel. It’s got 120 teeth. I counted them when you weren’t looking.","who":"Pip","radio":true,"phone":false},{"t":453.8215,"type":"voice","id":"s13","dlg":true,"sub":"120. Twenty years on that wheel, and I never knew that.","who":"Sam","radio":true,"phone":false},{"t":458.8455,"type":"voice","id":"n35","dlg":false,"sub":"The lamp was getting weaker. The steps were getting longer.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":464.4515,"type":"voice","id":"s14","dlg":true,"sub":"Pip. What do you want? Really.","who":"Sam","radio":true,"phone":false},{"t":468.3535,"type":"voice","id":"p12","dlg":true,"sub":"I want to know how it works. The railway. I want you to show me. Don't keep me out.","who":"Pip","radio":true,"phone":false},{"t":476.8365,"type":"voice","id":"n36","dlg":false,"sub":"It was the first time he had asked. And the first time he had listened to the answer.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":486.225,"type":"voice","id":"n36b","dlg":false,"sub":"Her door was frozen shut. The empty car beside hers was as close as he could get.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":495.05100000000004,"type":"voice","id":"s15","dlg":true,"sub":"Okay. Lesson one. These two cars are tied to the same cable. Neither one can move alone.","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":503.636,"type":"voice","id":"s16","dlg":true,"sub":"If we both let our brakes off, the heavier car goes down. And it pulls the lighter one up.","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":509.985,"type":"voice","id":"p13","dlg":true,"sub":"You’re heavier.","who":"Pip","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":511.244,"type":"voice","id":"s17","dlg":true,"sub":"Much heavier. So you go up, to the engine house, where the stove is. And I go down.","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":518.8240000000001,"type":"voice","id":"p14","dlg":true,"sub":"That’s not fair. You’ll be at the bottom, on your own.","who":"Pip","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":523.6320000000001,"type":"voice","id":"s18","dlg":true,"sub":"That’s how it works. One goes up because the other goes down.","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":528.2840000000001,"type":"voice","id":"n37","dlg":false,"sub":"Funiculars have worked this way since the 1800s. The motor barely lifts a thing. The weight of one car lifts the other.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":538.9840000000002,"type":"voice","id":"s19","dlg":true,"sub":"Red lever. Both hands. On three. One. Two. Three.","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":551.975,"type":"voice","id":"n38","dlg":false,"sub":"And that was how Sam Ferro learned the hardest thing a parent ever has to learn.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":558.783,"type":"voice","id":"n39","dlg":false,"sub":"Not how to hold on. How to let go. Slowly.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":575.1875,"type":"voice","id":"p15","dlg":true,"sub":"Dad? I made it. I’m by the big wheel.","who":"Pip","radio":true,"phone":false},{"t":580.0535,"type":"voice","id":"s20","dlg":true,"sub":"Good. Don’t touch anything.","who":"Sam","radio":true,"phone":false},{"t":582.8655,"type":"voice","id":"p16","dlg":true,"sub":"Too late.","who":"Pip","radio":true,"phone":false},{"t":589.875,"type":"voice","id":"n40","dlg":false,"sub":"The next morning, Sam almost didn’t look.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":594.698,"type":"voice","id":"n41","dlg":false,"sub":"The man in the glass was still grey. He still had the chipped mug.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":601.245,"type":"voice","id":"n42","dlg":false,"sub":"But the marks on the doorframe went all the way up. 16. 17. 19.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":609.464,"type":"voice","id":"n43","dlg":false,"sub":"And beside him stood a young woman in railway overalls, with a tool bag on her shoulder.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":617.2120000000001,"type":"voice","id":"n44","dlg":false,"sub":"She was still leaving. That part never changed.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":621.9040000000001,"type":"voice","id":"n45","dlg":false,"sub":"But now, she was coming back.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":627.056,"type":"voice","id":"p17","dlg":true,"sub":"Dad. Lesson two?","who":"Pip","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":629.6980000000001,"type":"voice","id":"s21","dlg":true,"sub":"Lesson two. Get your coat.","who":"Sam","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":637.625,"type":"voice","id":"n46","dlg":false,"sub":"The mirror never showed Sam his future. It showed him the man he’d become if he stayed exactly as he was.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":647.672,"type":"voice","id":"n47","dlg":false,"sub":"Ten years from now, you’ll be somebody you haven’t met yet. You still get to choose who.","radio":false,"phone":false},{"t":15.039,"type":"chime"},{"t":168.76250000000002,"type":"chime"},{"t":171.8625,"type":"chime"},{"t":173.01950000000002,"type":"chime"},{"t":185.77650000000006,"type":"chime"},{"t":188.62550000000005,"type":"chime"},{"t":215.775,"type":"chime"},{"t":219.244,"type":"chime"},{"t":224.95000000000002,"type":"chime"},{"t":228.70000000000002,"type":"chime"},{"t":233.079,"type":"chime"},{"t":239.01250000000002,"type":"chime"},{"t":242.56050000000002,"type":"chime"},{"t":267.7375,"type":"chime"},{"t":277.5005,"type":"chime"},{"t":280.96549999999996,"type":"chime"},{"t":362.08750000000003,"type":"chime"},{"t":368.16650000000004,"type":"chime"},{"t":371.6435,"type":"chime"},{"t":372.7015,"type":"chime"},{"t":378.09950000000003,"type":"chime"},{"t":494.60100000000006,"type":"chime"},{"t":503.18600000000004,"type":"chime"},{"t":509.535,"type":"chime"},{"t":510.79400000000004,"type":"chime"},{"t":518.374,"type":"chime"},{"t":523.182,"type":"chime"},{"t":538.5340000000001,"type":"chime"},{"t":626.606,"type":"chime"},{"t":629.248,"type":"chime"},{"t":427.65,"type":"squelch"},{"t":430.61199999999997,"type":"squelch"},{"t":436.925,"type":"squelch"},{"t":445.6625,"type":"squelch"},{"t":453.5715,"type":"squelch"},{"t":464.2015,"type":"squelch"},{"t":468.1035,"type":"squelch"},{"t":574.9375,"type":"squelch"},{"t":579.8035,"type":"squelch"},{"t":582.6155,"type":"squelch"},{"t":0.2,"type":"squeak"},{"t":0.9,"type":"squeak"},{"t":1.6,"type":"reveal"},{"t":14.789,"type":"recoil"},{"t":14.789,"type":"step","surf":"wood"},{"t":15.039,"type":"step","surf":"wood"},{"t":24.052,"type":"squeak"},{"t":25.052,"type":"squeak"},{"t":32.8125,"type":"title"},{"t":167.8125,"type":"step","surf":"wood"},{"t":168.1925,"type":"step","surf":"wood"},{"t":168.5725,"type":"step","surf":"wood"},{"t":168.9525,"type":"step","surf":"wood"},{"t":169.33249999999998,"type":"step","surf":"wood"},{"t":169.71249999999998,"type":"step","surf":"wood"},{"t":170.09249999999997,"type":"step","surf":"wood"},{"t":170.47249999999997,"type":"step","surf":"wood"},{"t":170.85249999999996,"type":"step","surf":"wood"},{"t":215.925,"type":"ice"},{"t":216.825,"type":"ice"},{"t":215.625,"type":"step","surf":"snow"},{"t":216.075,"type":"step","surf":"snow"},{"t":216.52499999999998,"type":"step","surf":"